WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.223
Every trade costs a little.

2
00:00:02.223 --> 00:00:06.050
A busy strategy pays it again and again.

3
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:09.042
Free trading: it grows 8% a year,

4
00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:12.869
trading its whole size 50 times a year.

5
00:00:13.169 --> 00:00:15.477
At 1 basis point a trade,

6
00:00:15.477 --> 00:00:16.631
Parity's default guess,

7
00:00:16.631 --> 00:00:18.919
it ends at $206.

8
00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:20.758
At 2 basis points,

9
00:00:20.758 --> 00:00:23.046
the double-cost test: $197.

10
00:00:23.346 --> 00:00:24.885
At 16 basis points,

11
00:00:24.885 --> 00:00:26.808
costs take all 8 points.

12
00:00:26.808 --> 00:00:29.481
It ends where it started.

13
00:00:29.781 --> 00:00:32.473
50 trades a year times 16 basis

14
00:00:32.473 --> 00:00:34.396
points is 800 basis points:

15
00:00:34.396 --> 00:00:36.300
the whole 8%.

16
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.523
Break-even is 16 basis points,

17
00:00:38.523 --> 00:00:43.365
far above the 1 basis point guess.
